Where the files of this directory come from

v1/tasks.json, funcs.json
    MedAgentBench (https://github.com/stanfordmlgroup/MedAgentBench), copied from the GRASP repository
    (https://github.com/jomoll/GRASP, commit 9d7d125), which vendors it. MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 Stanford
    Machine Learning Group; the licence text is below.

v2/tasks.json
    MedAgentBench v2 (https://github.com/ericoericochen/medagentbenchv2), copied from the GRASP repository, which
    vendors it. It remains the work of its authors; see that repository for its terms.

v3/tasks.json, split.json, workflows.json, warmstart.jsonl
    Written for MedicalRSI, under the licence of this repository (../../LICENSE). The first six task types of v3 are
    built from draft task templates in the MedAgentBench v2 repository (new_data_v1.json). The prompts in
    warmstart.jsonl quote records served by the MedAgentBench FHIR server.

